---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import leaf from '../assets/Favicon.svg';
---

<section id="inicio" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream-100">
	<div
		class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 -right-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-sage-200/50 blur-3xl md:h-96 md:w-96"
	>
	</div>
	<div
		class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-32 -left-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-terracotta-200/40 blur-3xl md:h-96 md:w-96"
	>
	</div>

	<div class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center gap-8 px-4 py-16 text-center md:px-6 md:py-28">
		<span
			class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-sage-100 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-sage-700"
		>
			<Image src={leaf} alt="" width={18} height={18} class="h-4 w-4" />
			Repostería natural en Ponferrada
		</span>

		<h1 class="max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl leading-tight text-sage-900 md:text-6xl">
			Dulces momentos hechos con ingredientes naturales
		</h1>

		<p class="max-w-2xl text-lg text-sage-700 md:text-xl">
			En Gisela Pastelería Natural elaboramos cada tarta y cada dulce de forma artesanal, cuidando
			el origen de nuestros ingredientes para que disfrutes de un sabor auténtico, día a día.
		</p>

		<div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
			<a
				href="#contacto"
				class="rounded-full bg-sage-400 px-8 py-3 font-medium text-white shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-sage-500"
			>
				Encarga tu tarta
			</a>
			<a
				href="https://www.instagram.com/gisela.pastelerianatural"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="rounded-full border border-sage-300 px-8 py-3 font-medium text-sage-700 transition-colors hover:bg-sage-100"
			>
				Síguenos en Instagram
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
